Adventures in Zambezia is the first film produced by Triggerfish Animation Studios and
distributed by Cinema Management Group and Sony Pictures in English territories.

15
01:02:15,000 --> 01:02:21,000
Adventures in Zambezia was theatrically released on 3 July 2012
and earned $34.4 million on a R173 million budget.

16
01:06:24,000 --> 01:06:30,000
It received Annie Award nominations for Music in an Animated Feature
Production and for Voice Acting in an Animated Feature Production.

17
01:10:33,000 --> 01:10:39,000
The film won the Best South African Feature Film at the
Durban International Film Festival in 2012.

18
01:14:42,000 --> 01:14:48,000
It also won Best Animation at the South African Film and Television Awards
and Best Animation at the 9th Africa Movie Academy Awards.

